  "about": "BL-037.9 (Dennis 20-11): which icon stands where on the chapter page and in Oefenen (Ontdekken). Chapter id → list of entries. Two kinds only. RELATED {icon, place, related:true}: the icon really belongs to that goal (place = item id of the chapter; the pair must be listed in 'fits'); label on hover/focus: 'Colosseum, Rome'. LOOSE {icon, at:[lon,lat], where, related:false}: never tied to a goal; real coordinates of a logical place (where = its name, for the report); label = the icon's own name only; at least 12 screen px EDGE TO EDGE (BL-039.5: from the lavender circle to the edge of every goal's shape, line or dot) from every goal of the chapter (measured at runtime, scripts/qa-v3-icons.mjs); the same loose icon may return in several chapters. A RELATED area entry may carry near:[lon,lat] (stand as near as possible to that real point) and avoid:[area ids] (stand nearer to its own area than to those). Icons are never drawn on or over a goal shape or line, and are hidden during Aanwijzen, Namen schrijven and Toets. 4–5 per chapter; none for Landen and Zeeën. The build checks every entry. Reports: ops/reports/BL-037-iconen.md, ops/reports/BL-039-iconen.md.",
